# OS
.DS_Store

# Everything under data/ is scraped output, not source: per-store CSVs, the
# SQLite database and the legacy JSON. It is 22 MB that changes on every run
# and is reproducible by scraping, so the repository carries code only.
#
# Consequence worth knowing: a fresh clone has no catalog. Run
# `tablero update` to scrape one, then `tablero migrate` to build the
# database. Your own data lives on your machine and in your backups.
data/

# pytest
.pytest_cache/

